83290.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['ICE out of our neighbourhoods’: Shooting of man sparks protests in New York]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134804207.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-out-of-our-neighbourhoods-shooting-of-dominican-man-sparks-protests-in-new-york/articleshow/134804207.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-out-of-our-neighbourhoods-shooting-of-dominican-man-sparks-protests-in-new-york/articleshow/134804207.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T07:44:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134804237,imgsize-129704.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Margaret Hamilton, scientist who worked on Nasa's Apollo programme, dies]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134803936.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Margaret Hamilton, an American scientist known for her work on NASA's Apollo program, has recently passed away. She played a crucial role in developing the software for the Apollo missions, ensuring safe lunar landings. Hamilton's contributions to computing have been recognized widely, including the awarding of the Presidential Medal of Freedom. Her work not only advanced technology but also inspired future generations in science and engineering.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/margaret-hamilton-scientist-who-worked-on-nasas-apollo-programme-dies/articleshow/134803936.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/margaret-hamilton-scientist-who-worked-on-nasas-apollo-programme-dies/articleshow/134803936.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T07:09:25+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134803934,imgsize-96976.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Family Asks For Privacy: FGTeeV Duddy’s ‘demons’ rant alarms fans; KreekCraft says he needs help]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800437.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[FGTeeV Duddy sparked concern after calling his family “the devil” and “demons” during an Instagram Live. He later said those comments did not reflect how he sees his children. Roblox creator KreekCraft said the family wanted the videos removed and asked viewers to give them privacy. The situation has drawn widespread attention across social media as the family handles events.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/fgteev-duddy-sparks-concern-after-calling-wife-children-demons-during-shocking-instagram-live/articleshow/134800437.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/fgteev-duddy-sparks-concern-after-calling-wife-children-demons-during-shocking-instagram-live/articleshow/134800437.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T02:20:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800438,imgsize-576903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Logo Sketch Auction: MrBeast’s 2018 tiger art heads to sale; estimate tops $20,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134802792.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[MrBeast’s original pencil sketch of his iconic tiger logo is heading to Heritage Auctions from October 23 to 25, 2026, with an estimated value of $20,000 or more. Created around 2018 during a 10-minute brainstorming session, the drawing predates the familiar blue design and pink lightning bolt. Despite the auction’s connection to his brand, IGN confirmed that the YouTube star is not involved in the sale.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/mrbeasts-original-logo-sketch-heads-to-auction-with-a-20000-price-estimate/articleshow/134802792.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/mrbeasts-original-logo-sketch-heads-to-auction-with-a-20000-price-estimate/articleshow/134802792.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T05:31:00+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134802798,imgsize-2142452.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[America has enjoyed the greatest free lunch in history: Vivek Wadhwa reacts to Green Card crackdown on 8 IT companies, says they aren't the visa abusers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800136.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/america-has-enjoyed-the-greatest-free-lunch-in-history-vivek-wadhwa-reacts-to-green-card-crackdown-on-8-it-companies-says-they-arent-the-visa-abusers/articleshow/134800136.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/america-has-enjoyed-the-greatest-free-lunch-in-history-vivek-wadhwa-reacts-to-green-card-crackdown-on-8-it-companies-says-they-arent-the-visa-abusers/articleshow/134800136.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T01:18:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800146,imgsize-57126.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin doctor mom arrested and charged in Florida as she watched 7-year-old drown. She said she froze, she was not strong enough to pull him from water]]></title><description>&